  Description: Prerequisite Region - Mwangi Expanse You studied magic at the prestigious
    Magaambya academy in Nantambu, learning magical traditions dating back to Old-
    Mage Jatembe and earning a pedigree respected by magical scholars almost everywhere.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in your choice of either the Arcana
    or Nature skill, as well as the Academia Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Recognize
    Spell] skill feat.
